          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}3-x&=3-\\left(-\\frac34\\right)\\\\3-x&=3+\\frac34\\\\3-x&=3\\frac34\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 27
      },
      {
